  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252fskeeder461\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1512050/description_256b6a72-f787-4081-b8ee-ecac2633c280.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"428\" height=\"122\"></a></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">關於 FOOTAGE：<br></span></strong></h1>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><span style=\"color:#117077\">FOOTAGE</span> 是一款適用於<span style=\"color:#21a112\"> Minecraft</span> <span style=\"color:#843fa1\">Java</span> <span style=\"color:#3598db\">著色包</span>，版本涵蓋<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">1.20</span> 至 <span style=\"color:#e67e23\">1.21.11</span>，提供<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">大量</span>高品質的隨身攝影機與 VHS 效果，以及超寫實的光照、霧氣與陰影，同時仍保持<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">極佳的效能優化</span></span></strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1512050/description_6788aa8e-4d3d-4017-b3e2-0b3353328cd9.png\"></span></strong></p>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><br><br></span></strong></h3>\n<h1><strong><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><br><span style=\"color:#17a2ae\">FOOTAGE 的部分功能：</span></span></strong></h1>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">-<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">超寫實光照/全域照明</span><br>-<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">體積光<br><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">-<span style=\"color:#236fa1\">體積霧氣</span><br>-<span style=\"color:#21a112\">著色草叢模擬&nbsp;</span></span><br>-<span style=\"color:#169179\">大量隨身攝影機效果</span><br>-<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">大量 VHS 效果<br>-<span style=\"color:#3598db\">水面模擬</span><br>-<span style=\"color:#34495e\">著色鳥類</span><br>-<span style=\"color:#17a2ae\">體積霧氣<br>-<span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">體積雲層<br>-<span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">完整表面渲染並支援資源包<br>-<span style=\"color:#1fd80a\">光線追蹤反射<br>-<span style=\"color:#21a112\">DLSS<br>-<span style=\"color:#bc8444\">鏡頭髒污效果<br>-<span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">大量其他後處理效果（景深、色差等）<br>-超細緻手電筒<br>-<span style=\"color:#17a2ae\">還有超多更多功能-<br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<h3><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1512050/description_cb5ae82d-5b64-4163-951b-925ad6c0cdfe.png\"></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1512050/description_8b4f98da-91dd-4628-b861-e899980c009f.png\"></span></strong><br><br><br><br></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#17a2ae\"><strong>我的電腦能運行這個著色包嗎？<br></strong></span></h1>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><strong>~12 格渲染距離下的 FPS</strong></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">RTX</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#fb1c03\">4090</span>&nbsp;</strong><strong>12GB - - - - - - - - -&nbsp;&nbsp;230 FPS<br><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">RTX</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#21a112\">3090</span>&nbsp;8GB - - - - - - - - - -&nbsp;&nbsp;210&nbsp;FPS<br><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">RTX</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">4070</span>&nbsp;8GB <span style=\"color:#236fa1\">筆記型電腦</span> - - - - -&nbsp;210&nbsp;FPS<br><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">RTX</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">2060</span>&nbsp;8GB - - - - - - - - - - -150&nbsp;FPS<br><span style=\"color:#21a112\">GTX </span><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">1650</span> 4GB<span style=\"color:#236fa1\"> 筆記型電腦</span> - - - - - 130 FPS &lt;筆電反而跑出更高 FPS<br><span style=\"color:#21a112\">GTX</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#843fa1\">1650ti</span>&nbsp;4GB- - - - -&nbsp;- - - - -110 FPS<br><span style=\"color:#21a112\">GTX</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">650ti</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">超頻版</span> 1GB - - - - -&nbsp;&nbsp;50&nbsp;FPS<br><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">8800</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#1fd80a\">GT</span>&nbsp;512MB&nbsp;- - - - - - - - -&nbsp;&nbsp;10 FPS &lt;令人驚嘆的 2007 年顯示卡<br></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">加入我們的 Discord</span>: <a href=\"https://discord.gg/dfTK72W3Y5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FOOTAGE DISCORD</a></strong></h2>\n<h2><strong><span style=\"color:#21a112\">支持作者</span><span style=\"color:#21a112\">？</span>: <a href=\"buymeacoffee.com/skeeder461\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">請我喝杯咖啡</a></strong></h2>\n<h3><strong>&nbsp;</strong></h3>",
